  "src": "本站自绘（VCAP_SERVICES 字段名随绑定/平台版本可能不同，标 ~ 处请以自己环境为准）",
  "caption": "cf env 里的 VCAP_SERVICES：xsuaa 绑定的 xsappname / clientid / url 就在这，排查 401 先看它绑的是哪个实例",
  "lh": 18,
  "lines": [
    "$ cf env demo-node-srv | jq '.VCAP_SERVICES.xsuaa[0] | {name, label, plan, tags}'",
    "{",
    "  \"name\": \"demo-node-uaa\",",
    "  \"label\": \"xsuaa\",",
    "  \"plan\": \"application\",",
    "  \"tags\": [ \"xsuaa\" ]",
    "}",
    "$ cf env demo-node-srv | jq '.VCAP_SERVICES.xsuaa[0].credentials | keys'",
    "[",
    "  \"apiurl\", \"clientid\", \"clientsecret\", \"identityzone\", \"identityzoneid\",",
    "  \"tenantid\", \"tenantmode\", \"uaadomain\", \"url\", \"verificationkey\", \"xsappname\"",
    "]",
    "$ cf env demo-node-srv | jq -r '.VCAP_SERVICES.xsuaa[0].credentials.xsappname'",
    "demo-node-trial-dev",
    "$ cf env demo-node-srv | jq -r '.VCAP_SERVICES.xsuaa[0].credentials.url'",
    "https://trial-dev-demo-node.authentication.ap10.hana.ondemand.com",
    "",
    "# 排错要点：",
    "#  · xsappname 与 JWT 里 scope 前缀不一致 → 403（换过实例或改过 xsappname）",
    "#  · uaadomain / url 指向别的子账户 → token 校验失败（issuer 不匹配）→ 401",
    "#  · clientsecret 只看前 4 位核对，别整串贴进聊天记录"
  ],
